{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/31460757f61f2cb9c942add000dc9d7f.avif?t=1774601048\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add your pet to the game! Send your friend via the <strong>community hub</strong> or <strong>discord</strong>, and they will be <strong>permanently</strong> added to the <strong>HALL OF FAME</strong> on the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/4a2b28dc83b74e677494f30870f401e3.avif?t=1774601048\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fasthand \u2013 a game that started as a simple aiming challenge, but turned into something much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candy factory has been taken over by an army of unbearable sweets, and it\u2019s up to you to stop them! Grab your wafer gun and fight your way through 6 expanded levels filled with sugary enemies, all leading to the ultimate showdown with the mighty gingerbread boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know DOOM, you\u2019ll feel right at home - this is basically a sweet, candy-coated DOOM experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend, the dog \u201cFelek,\u201d will be by your side every step of the way, helping you in your battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FASTHAND is perfect for players looking for both action and relaxation. Jump into intense fights, or take a break and chill in the menu with the built-in LOFI music player (yes - your favorite tracks!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s also an extra mini-game included - PONG - you definitely know it, and you can play it with 2 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning - the game is constantly being expanded and improved, so expect even more content in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.poster.avif?t=1774601048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.webm?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.mp4?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.poster.avif?t=1774601048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.webm?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.mp4?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This is my very first game \u2014 and yes, I\u2019m making it solo! Since launch, I\u2019ve learned a lot, and you can see that progress reflected above. I hope you enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m constantly learning new things and will continue adding more updates to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for giving my little game a shot. Every \u201cPlay\u201d click means the world to me \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! \ud83c\udfae</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sweet Beginning ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/f5d98ae1f1f061e64b7a947b2a33217361c98f46.jpg"},{"name":"Conveyor Belts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/32e250449d544b7bdd3ef20edb0594e7c6c6aeb4.jpg"},{"name":"Slide to the Fridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/9004c45611030fe345d01126655a6dc38c399098.jpg"},{"name":"Frozen Chamber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/b39af30f77a2a40c80427b7c727c33084f662849.jpg"},{"name":"Sandwich Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/01f8e9530aae88232035182de36702b295a44b80.jpg"},{"name":"The Milk Has Spilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/ff0047ab56b77b4760db366010457920667f8667.jpg"},{"name":"Lofi Lover!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/b75ac4e2099c13939dca2acd652b14b7c6040630.jpg"},{"name":"Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/85bab0985ca58d3f4195eaa1b345ed29dff61e2d.jpg"},{"name":"Heavenly Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/1b2241e600de4d23724c8f405c12b8f812e9fcfd.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843070/1b9b357978ff61bfb9de572176fe11c77166c5f8.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843070?t=1774601048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/190b1f436bc6da28ab5e9aaa8dbd1575e77b8bbd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774601048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/b7dc72c49331a6aec31fc76a1b5e54a917ff71d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774601048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/b7dc72c49331a6aec31fc76a1b5e54a917ff71d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774601048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/31460757f61f2cb9c942add000dc9d7f.avif?t=1774601048\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add your pet to the game! Send your friend via the <strong>community hub</strong> or <strong>discord</strong>, and they will be <strong>permanently</strong> added to the <strong>HALL OF FAME</strong> on the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/4a2b28dc83b74e677494f30870f401e3.avif?t=1774601048\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fasthand \u2013 a game that started as a simple aiming challenge, but turned into something much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candy factory has been taken over by an army of unbearable sweets, and it\u2019s up to you to stop them! Grab your wafer gun and fight your way through 6 expanded levels filled with sugary enemies, all leading to the ultimate showdown with the mighty gingerbread boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know DOOM, you\u2019ll feel right at home - this is basically a sweet, candy-coated DOOM experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend, the dog \u201cFelek,\u201d will be by your side every step of the way, helping you in your battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FASTHAND is perfect for players looking for both action and relaxation. Jump into intense fights, or take a break and chill in the menu with the built-in LOFI music player (yes - your favorite tracks!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s also an extra mini-game included - PONG - you definitely know it, and you can play it with 2 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning - the game is constantly being expanded and improved, so expect even more content in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.poster.avif?t=1774601048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.webm?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.mp4?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.poster.avif?t=1774601048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.webm?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.mp4?t=1774601048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This is my very first game \u2014 and yes, I\u2019m making it solo! Since launch, I\u2019ve learned a lot, and you can see that progress reflected above. I hope you enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m constantly learning new things and will continue adding more updates to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for giving my little game a shot. Every \u201cPlay\u201d click means the world to me \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! \ud83c\udfae</p>","developers":["mefyu video games (MVG)"],"dlc":[3914890,3870770,3908740,4529760],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/9e93ebcdd1805a9621f890e2000f2332a0222d37/header.jpg?t=1774601048","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"FASTHAND \u00a9 2026 mefyu video games (MVG) ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.<br />\r\nTHIS GAME AND ALL ASSOCIATED ASSETS ARE PROTECTED UNDER COPYRIGHT LAW.<br />\r\nUNAUTHORIZED COPYING, DISTRIBUTION, OR MODIFICATION IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS Holo<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS Holo<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3843070/1785736327/26f1996e3907216ece1e8b92ebaa499d29cb9bbd/1771522237/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771528052","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3843070/1785736327/26f1996e3907216ece1e8b92ebaa499d29cb9bbd/1771522237/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771528052","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co