l, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSimple but engaging gameplay. A retro atmosphere with straightforward mechanics. A light, fast-paced training game built on a simple idea that works well as short entertainment or a tool for sharpening reflexes.\u201d<br>Polski-Gaming<br><br>\u201cIt was quite a nostalgic and amusing experience, sending cute little creatures to the other side while reminiscing about the good old days of Wolfenstein xD\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 Strawberry Oomfies [PL]<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/1691ff96e45bfd005a3d6b6b2622b6069d9020f4/ss_1691ff96e45bfd005a3d6b6b2622b6069d9020f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774601048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/1691ff96e45bfd005a3d6b6b2622b6069d9020f4/ss_1691ff96e45bfd005a3d6b6b2622b6069d9020f4.600x338.jpg?t=1774601048"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/2b676a3d5cddce49a62764395b54771cc6d70c71/ss_2b676a3d5cddce49a62764395b54771cc6d70c71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774601048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/2b676a3d5cddce49a62764395b54771cc6d70c71/ss_2b676a3d5cddce49a62764395b54771cc6d70c71.600x338.jpg?t=1774601048"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/9c5f38369ad1b4c5ed24e4eb032e47931108734b/ss_9c5f38369ad1b4c5ed24e4eb032e47931108734b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774601048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/9c5f38369ad1b4c5ed24e4eb032e47931108734b/ss_9c5f38369ad1b4c5ed24e4eb032e47931108734b.600x338.jpg?t=1774601048"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/fddaeafb6f3337fff1dc15e637ee96ddf8d49d7e/ss_fddaeafb6f3337fff1dc15e637ee96ddf8d49d7e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774601048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.ak